@startuml review-process
!theme plain
title Review-exchange process — phases and when commands are sent

' Logical actors (host-independent roles per D5)
participant "Producer agent" as Producer
participant "Transport\n(Syncthing rut-Projects_artifacts /\nshared filesystem)" as Transport
participant "Consumer agent\n(runs /review)" as Consumer
participant "review-agent" as ReviewAgent

== Phase 0 — capture (EXPLICIT) ==
Producer -> Producer : invoke review-exchange capture\nassemble context_snapshot
Producer -> Transport : write package\n.local-artifacts/review/<reviewId>/<messageId>/
note right of Producer
  artifacts first, message.json last
  (JSON presence = readiness signal)
end note

== Phase 1 — transfer (AUTOMATIC) ==
Transport -> Transport : moves package
note right of Transport
  remote: Syncthing rut-Projects_artifacts
  local:  same filesystem (no sync)
end note

== Phase 2 — open / investigate (EXPLICIT) ==
Consumer -> Consumer : /review   (explicit command)
Consumer -> Transport : locate\nnewest complete context_snapshot
Consumer -> Consumer : validate\nschema / integrity / dedup /\nsupersession / containment / identity
Consumer -> Consumer : materialize\nverify OIDs (cat-file -e) +\nwrite diff into materialized/<messageId>/

== Phase 3 — review (runs after materialize) ==
Consumer -> ReviewAgent : hand off materialized diff\n+ validated context
ReviewAgent -> ReviewAgent : produce findings

== Phase 4 — return (EXPLICIT, later — OUT OF SCOPE) ==
note over Consumer, ReviewAgent
  review_result / investigation_request
  via Projects/.artifacts--processed/review
  (folder RESERVED only; producers/consumers = later work)
end note

legend right
  When commands are sent:
  | capture (Phase 0)       | explicit  |
  | transfer (Phase 1)      | automatic |
  | open/investigate (Ph 2) | explicit  |
  | return (Phase 4)        | explicit (later) |
endlegend
@enduml
